            <div class="script-line">Please sit down in a comfortable position.</div>
            <div class="script-line">I am going to invite you to close your eyes. If you are not comfortable closing your eyes, please just look down at your hands to respect the people around you.</div>
            <div class="script-line">Please listen to the sound as long as you can.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tip-box"><strong>🔔 Ring chime → wait for sound to end, then continue:</strong></div>
          <div class="script-box">
            <div class="script-line">Bring your attention to your breath. <em>(PAUSE)</em></div>
            <div class="script-line">If your mind wanders, that's okay; just bring your focus back to your breath. <em>(PAUSE)</em></div>
            <div class="script-line">Breathe in through your nose and out through your mouth or nose.</div>
            <div class="script-line">Notice your belly rise and fall. <em>(PAUSE)</em></div>
            <div class="script-line">If your mind wanders, that's okay; just bring your focus back to your breath. <em>(PAUSE)</em></div>
            <div class="script-line">When you hear the chime again, listen as long as you can. When you can't hear the sound any longer, slowly look up and bring your attention back to the room.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tip-box"><strong>🔔 Ring chime → Allow 30–45 seconds for full return.</strong></div>
